# Project specific R8 rules.
# AGP combines every *.keep file in src/main/keepRules and passes it to R8.
# https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules
#
# Nothing is needed right now: the app uses ViewBinding (no reflection), org.json from the
# framework, and plain enums that are looked up through values() / explicit string tags.
# If you later add reflection or a JSON library, add its keep rules here.
